        "id": 116505,
        "name": "eggroll20xd6",
        "username": "eggroll20xd6",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/eggroll20xd6/{size}/1993_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-28T01:16:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>While it would be fun to see lots of teams in SotM, I don't think it is necessary. &nbsp;If you look at most comic book heroes, unless they have their own mainstream team-up comic, heroes tend to show up from time to time. &nbsp;That and there will be times where teams end due to conflict. &nbsp;I think the great thing about SotM is that really specific teams don't need to exist. &nbsp;The promos associated with those teams are nice, but I love mixing up a member of the FF, DW, and PW with another random hero in different environments against diffrent villains. &nbsp;At this point at least if there were going to be another \"promo team,\" they would probably have to be a team that travels through time correcting timelines.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:48:56.772Z",
