        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/{size}/2150_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-28T01:23:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In comics, there often tend to be many small teams. For example, look at Wolverine. Last I counted, he was on 16-17 different teams that a lot of people unacquainted with comic minutia wouldn't even know about. So, that said, it's possible that each character in SotM is on just as many teams that we'll never see.</p>",
