        "id": 116508,
        "name": "Under3",
        "username": "Under3",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/under3/{size}/1872_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-28T15:18:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’d really like to see a 3 hero team, purely for gameplay reasons: the game works for 3, 4 and 5 heroes, we have teams for 4 and 5, even one for 6 if we want to push the limits of the game but not one yet for 3. It would be nice to cover all of them.</p>\n<p>Thinking in terms of background I’d love to see an irreverent team, sort of like Nextwave in style as some characters in the setting would really suit it - obviously Guise would be first choice for a wisecracking meta-statement hero like in Nextwave, but Unity is also a strong contender and it would be nice to see her on a team which actually wants her on it.</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:48:56.982Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
