        "created_at": "2014-08-28T21:55:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, we do see Unity-bot in the freedom 6, so there is that. (Not that they can't be on more than one team: like Tempest.)</p><p>I would definitely love to see some more teams in the game, but I understand how they don't all lend themselves to regular teams. (Though, I have to say that, although we've known Fanatic was in the Prime Wardens for some time now, I always saw her more of a loner {Like Ra}. So it's weird to see her as a regular member of this high powered team.)</p>",
